mazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"The episode delves into the intricacies of designing and manufacturing smart rings, exploring the challenges of miniaturization, power management, and user experience. Mr. Patel shares his insights on the future of wearable technology and the potential of smart rings to revolutionize the way we interact with our digital world.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Miniaturization is the hardest part of wearable tech.\n- Power management defines user retention.\n- Health tracking and daily living integration.\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e8","title":"Colorpik AI Smart Pen","guest":"Steve Wang","product":"Colorpik","date":"2023-11-08","image":"/media/s2/8.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=V-xad4CYvis","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"The world's first pen that can scan and reproduce any color in the universe. A revolutionary tool for artists and designers.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Colorpik\n- Discussion with Steve Wang\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e7","title":"BackAware Workout Belt","guest":"Dr. Peter O'Sullivan","product":"BackAware","date":"2023-11-07","image":"/media/s2/7.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=Dx08Oxq65eg","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"A smart belt utilizing AI to provide real-time feedback on back posture during workouts, preventing injury and maximizing efficiency.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about BackAware\n- Discussion with Dr. Peter O'Sullivan\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e6","title":"Whispp","guest":"Joris Castermans","product":"Whispp App","date":"2023-11-06","image":"/media/s2/6.png","youtubeLink":"https://www.youtube.com/@Adapt-ImplementingInnovations","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"AI-powered speech technology that converts whispered speech into a clear and natural voice for people with voice disabilities.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Whispp App\n- Discussion with Joris Castermans\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e5","title":"Baracoda","guest":"Thomas Serval","product":"BMind Mirror","date":"2023-11-05","image":"/media/s2/5.png","youtubeLink":"https://www.youtube.com/@Adapt-ImplementingInnovations","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Pioneering the daily healthtech revolution with the world's first AI-powered smart mirror for mental wellness and stress management.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about BMind Mirror\n- Discussion with Thomas Serval\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e4","title":"Notpla","guest":"Callum Rhodes","product":"Notpla Packaging","date":"2023-11-04","image":"/media/s2/4.png","youtubeLink":"https://www.youtube.com/@Adapt-ImplementingInnovations","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Revolutionary packaging that disappears. Made from seaweed and plants, Notpla offers a sustainable alternative to single-use plastics.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Notpla Packaging\n- Discussion with Callum Rhodes\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e3","title":"Honda Hydrogen","guest":"Honda R&D","product":"CR-V e:FCEV","date":"2023-11-03","image":"/media/s2/3.png","youtubeLink":"https://www.youtube.com/@Adapt-ImplementingInnovations","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Implementing innovations in hydrogen fuel cell technology. Exploring the future of sustainable mobility with Honda's latest advancements.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about CR-V e:FCEV\n- Discussion with Honda R&D\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e2","title":"Neuro-Law Special","guest":"Joseph Wszalek","product":"Neuro-Law","date":"2023-11-02","image":"/media/s2/2.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=Tt4CBcyt-2c","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"A deep dive into the intersection of neuroscience and law. How brain science is changing the way we understand justice and responsibility.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Neuro-Law\n- Discussion with Joseph Wszalek\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s2-e1","title":"Nuwa Smart Pen","guest":"Marc Tuinier","product":"Nuwa Pen","date":"2023-11-01","image":"/media/s2/1.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtube.com/watch?v=TRuFpK_j-YE","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Reinventing the pen for the digital age. This AI-powered ballpoint pen digitizes your handwriting on any paper.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Nuwa Pen\n- Discussion with Marc Tuinier\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e8","title":"Ehrman Crest School","guest":"Timothy J. Eiler","product":"Ehrman Crest","date":"2023-05-08","image":"/media/s1/16.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/CRt8Whi_K4c","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Exploring the layout of the future. How Ehrman Crest is redefining education through architecture and design.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Ehrman Crest\n- Discussion with Timothy J. Eiler\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e7","title":"FeaturePrint","guest":"Mr.Roei Ganzarski","product":"FeaturePrint","date":"2023-05-07","image":"/media/s1/15.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/ZFkU_g8cGI0","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Authenticating products with a single photo. The physics of uniqueness and the end of counterfeiting.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about FeaturePrint\n- Discussion with Mr.Roei Ganzarski\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e6","title":"GACW","guest":"Dr. Zoltan Kemeney","product":"Air Sus. Wheels","date":"2023-05-06","image":"/media/s1/14.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/oljsu5EuXZw","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Reinventing the wheel. Air suspension technology for heavy machinery that improves efficiency and durability.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Air Sus. Wheels\n- Discussion with Dr. Zoltan Kemeney\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e5","title":"AI Art Theft Prevention","guest":"Dr. Shawn Shan","product":"Glaze AI Prevention","date":"2023-05-05","image":"/media/s1/13.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/FaUqpbqMcps","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Protecting art from theft. How AI is revolutionizing the art world and keeping priceless works safe.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Glaze AI Prevention\n- Discussion with Dr. Shawn Shan\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e4","title":"Rainstick Shower","guest":"Alisha McFetridge","product":"Rainstick","date":"2023-05-04","image":"/media/s1/12.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/Q4RHkE_ojBE","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"The sustainable shower of the future. Saving water and energy without compromising the shower experience.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about Rainstick\n- Discussion with Alisha McFetridge\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e3","title":"NAQi Neural Earbuds","guest":"Dave Segal","product":"NAQI Earbuds","date":"2023-05-03","image":"/media/s1/11.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/-fH-FkjSY-s","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Control digital devices with your mind? Neural earbuds and the future of human-computer interfaces.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about NAQI Earbuds\n- Discussion with Dave Segal\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e2","title":"XVision Headset","guest":"Augmedics Team","product":"XVision","date":"2023-05-02","image":"/media/s1/10.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/z6naGP1PY74","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"Augmented reality for surgeons. Giving doctors x-ray vision to see through anatomy during complex procedures.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about XVision\n- Discussion with Augmedics Team\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"},{"id":"s1-e1","title":"AI Assisted Architecture","guest":"Architecture Team","product":"AI Design","date":"2023-05-01","image":"/media/s1/9.png","youtubeLink":"https://youtu.be/YKkqn0x3mEQ","spotifyLink":"","appleLink":"","amazonLink":"","castboxLink":"","content":"How AI is shaping the skyline. The role of generative design in modern construction and urban planning.\n\n## Key Takeaways\n- Insight about AI Design\n- Discussion with Architecture Team\n- Transforming the industry\n\n## Full Transcript\n*This is a placeholder for the full transcript of the episode. You can paste the actual transcript here later.*\n"}]}]]}]]}]
